# Windurst Woods gate: Rakoh Buuma plays 114 twice; the finish with option 0 does nothing, with option 4 begins 2-2
# (SPECIAL 6755, current 4 at status 1).
# Rival zone-in: entering Windurst Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure mission Rumors from the West, 839 (another
# mission's script, not this one); its finish writes that mission's status 4 (area 12).
lists WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=108,-5,-24 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
login
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed   # a GM: 1-1 done
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter current
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed          # a GM: 1-2 done
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace current
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed              # a GM: 1-3 done
mission Windurst LostForWords current
mission Windurst LostForWords completed                 # a GM: 2-1 done
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                  # 114
finish option=0
trigger Rakoh_Buuma
finish option=4
